  "description": "AI agents for Webority products on the Microsoft Agent Framework: one agent factory with bounded retry, a daily spend cap, OpenTelemetry GenAI spans, [AgentFunction] tool discovery with audited and redacted tool calls, typed structured output, and the usage, price and tool-call tables a product maps into its own DbContext. Carries the Azure OpenAI v1 transport (AddWeborityAiAzureOpenAi) and only generally available dependencies; the Azure AI Foundry transport is the separate Webority.Ai.Foundry package.",
